# Shared kernel

Charter: `src/core/AGENTS.md`.

`EventBus.js` and `Constants.js` are the only legal cross-agent types. Topic names live in Constants; schemas live in `CONTRACTS.md`. Both must change together.

```javascript
// ❌ INVALID
import * as THREE from 'three'
EventBus.emit('randomTopic', { mesh: tankMesh })

// ✅ VALID
EventBus.emit(Topics.TANK_DAMAGED, { entityId, currentHp, maxHp })
```

No DOM, no fetch, no gameplay formulas. Payloads must be JSON-serializable.
